{"id": "DePKZQzH5o-", "title": "Video by anchorlinedigital", "description": "Diamonds aren't rare. One ad made you believe they were. 💎\n\nIn 1938, De Beers hired the agency N.W. Ayer to save collapsing diamond sales.\nIn 1947, copywriter Frances Gerety wrote four words: \"A Diamond Is Forever.\"\nAd Age later named it the slogan of the century.\n\nThe tradition you grew up with? It started as a marketing brief.\n\nSend this to someone who's about to buy a ring. 💍\n\n#marketinghistory #advertising #diamonds #storytelling #copywriting #anchorlinedigital", "channel": "anchorlinedigital", "uploader_id": "25349745254", "uploader": "Anchorline", "timestamp": 1791470204, "like_count": 29, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18120433936841255a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.053, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMq89FJti4KLyopqsdoqunDkuRdW53CZD8hsyt1vrZWHWE4kCKcYhL0jXSAq6ioc1SwA759yuVzzKTBAjGczPyK05b5JRADQeHAlw4.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdqompCUqt2LhgxngWXT8ZqcfAWnX2nrrD-IKMsQkHK3wLnXwByDGTOOCDo28l3c93OUNcwTx1dNEgfod8ychaWR&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dRzZ2ugDzDMQ7kNvwH5I6N_&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=YOsOEI_K8ZTUwl2c5HQmvQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTTo9odP5m55ipLaZymhVb2owud8nU9X6hhtq2EB1ndag&oe=6AF46913", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.053, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x6